# Never publish: files from a camera, your own settings, or software that isn't ours to share.
# See "Licences and what must not be shared" in PROVENANCE.md.

# The camera's own libraries (Qualcomm's qmmf clients and Android's camera metadata), copied from a
# camera only to link vaidk-camd. No published licence.
*.so
*.so.*
# The vendor boot script, and InitCamx.vaidk built from it on each camera. No licence.
InitCamx
InitCamx.*
# A camera's settings, Wi-Fi network, admin account and setup-network password: /data/misc/vaidk,
# /persist/data/wifi.bin, and copies of /opt/vaidk (which holds InitCamx.vaidk).
vaidk/
vaidk.conf
wpa_supplicant.conf
wifi.bin
# Partition images and backups hold all of the above, plus the camera's SSH host keys.
*.img
backup/
backups/
# Recordings and logs can capture your home, its sounds and your network's names.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.h264
*.h265
*.aac
*.wav
*.log

# The build toolchain: build.ps1 downloads it from Arm into its cache.
gcc-linaro-*/
*.tar.xz

# Clutter from operating systems, editors and Python.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
